@AwsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142

### List public S3 buckets by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/s3/public-buckets?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List EC2 instances with open inbound ports by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ec2/open-ports?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List RDS instances with open inbound ports by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rds/open-ports?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List IAM access keys
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/access-keys
Accept: application/json

###
